        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "\/\/ Ambil output teks dari AI Agent\nlet outputText = $input.first().json.output || \"\";\n\n\/\/ 1. Hapus jika formatnya memakai tag <think>...<\/think>\noutputText = outputText.replace(\/<think>[\\s\\S]*?<\\\/think>\/gi, '');\n\n\/\/ 2. Hapus jika AI menulis \"Here's a thinking process: ...\" hingga batas jawaban asli\nif (outputText.includes(\"Here's a thinking process:\")) {\n  \/\/ Potong teks dan ambil bagian paling akhir setelah pemikiran selesai\n  let lines = outputText.split(\"\\n\\n\");\n  \/\/ Mengambil paragraf\/bagian respon bersih di baris akhir\n  outputText = lines.slice(-1)[0]; \n}\n\n\/\/ 3. Bersihkan sisa spasi atau enter liar\nlet cleanedText = outputText.trim();\n\n\/\/ Kembalikan objek JSON yang bersih\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    status: \"success\",\n    message: cleanedText\n  }\n}];"
            },
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
                176,
                512
            ],
            "id": "0db839cb-ff0c-4327-addd-672b3bf2e229",
            "name": "Code in JavaScript"
        },
        {
            "parameters": {
                "jsCode": "const inputData = $input.first().json;\nconst body = inputData.body || inputData;\n\nconst sessionId = body.session_id || \"default_session\";\nconst userMessage = body.message || \"\";\nconst chatHistory = body.history || []; \/\/ Kosong jika sesi biasa (tanpa project)\n\n\/\/ 1. Filter pesan canceled & format history dari sesi saudara\nlet formattedHistory = \"\";\nif (Array.isArray(chatHistory) && chatHistory.length > 0) {\n  formattedHistory = chatHistory\n    .filter(h => !h.is_canceled) \/\/ Mengabaikan pesan yang dibatalkan user\n    .map(h => `${h.role === 'user' ? 'User' : 'AI'}: ${h.content}`)\n    .join('\\n');\n}\n\n\/\/ 2. Susun prompt gabungan\nlet combinedPrompt = userMessage;\nif (formattedHistory) {\n  combinedPrompt = `Konteks dari sesi lain di proyek ini:\\n${formattedHistory}\\n\\nPertanyaan User saat ini:\\n${userMessage}`;\n}\n\n\/\/ 3. Hash rute untuk 3 cabang AI Agent (0, 1, 2)\nfunction hashCode(str) {\n  let hash = 0;\n  for (let i = 0; i < str.length; i++) {\n    hash = (hash << 5) - hash + str.charCodeAt(i);\n    hash |= 0;\n  }\n  return Math.abs(hash);\n}\n\nconst assignedRoute = hashCode(String(sessionId)) % 3;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ...inputData,\n    message: combinedPrompt, \/\/ Dikirim ke AI Agent\n    assigned_route: assignedRoute\n  }\n}];"
            },
            "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
            "typeVersion": 2,
            "position": [
